      "en": "Surely after that I was turned. I repented. After that I was instructed. I struck my thigh. I was ashamed, yes, even confounded, because I bore the reproach of my youth.’",
      "ko": "내가 돌이킴을 받은 후에 뉘우쳤고 내가 교훈을 받은 후에 내 볼기를 쳤사오니 이는 어렸을 때의 치욕을 진고로 부끄럽고 욕됨이니이다 하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "faabe2a326f3fbe871abbf9255e0e2e81ace9030f609feba1d187ec0f9094e94",
      "translation_text_hash": "28a148e7f7e826ca7c430a8692dbd10facbd908964ead11ad972f2b5448962f4",
