      "en": "But everyone will die for his own iniquity. Every man who eats the sour grapes, his teeth will be set on edge.",
      "ko": "신 포도를 먹는 자마다 그 이가 심 같이 각기 자기 죄악으로만 죽으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "5cd9d0060b98a95efcef6a77ba69e453857704f836ce57259deb885271256c52",
      "translation_text_hash": "bda7b0bc091e3b747ad9e677909773bfbfd2f42418f29c416f9ef2a90efa9cbf",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
